&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Place collection markers such as &lt;code&gt;{{ds.lines.sku}}&lt;/code&gt; on a template row so the engine inserts one row per element&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set expansion direction with &lt;code&gt;E=V&lt;/code&gt; (vertical, default) or &lt;code&gt;E=H&lt;/code&gt; (horizontal)&lt;/li&gt;
